category: Interpreters
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Minimal BASIC programming language interpreter as defined by ECMA-55"
ldesc: "bas55 is an implementation of the Minimal BASIC programming language as
defined by the ECMA-55 standard. bas55 provides an interpreter and an editor
with line renumbering capabilities."
